2025/09/08 19:07:38 [translate] Response: [[["Today, bloggers have become an important channel for brand promotion. ","Сегодня блогеры стали важным каналом продвижения брендов. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["But not every blogger will give the expected result: some have a “living” audience, others have a wound, someone works in your niche, and someone is generally far from it. ","Но не каждый блогер даст ожидаемый результат: у одних аудитория «живая», у других — накрученная, кто-то работает в вашей нише, а кто-то вообще далёк от неё. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["How to understand whether it is worth placing advertising?\n\n","Как понять, стоит ли размещать рекламу?\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["We have collected key criteria by which you can analyze a blogger before cooperation.\n\n","Мы собрали ключевые критерии, по которым можно анализировать блогера перед сотрудничеством.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["1. Number of subscribers ≠ Efficiency\n\n","1. Количество подписчиков ≠ эффективность\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["A large audience does not yet guarantee success. ","Большая аудитория ещё не гарантирует успех. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["It is important to look not at the figure, but at the quality of the subscribers: is it a real audience or bot.\n\n","Важно смотреть не на цифру, а на качество подписчиков: реальная ли это аудитория или боты.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["2. Employment (ER - Engagement Rate)\n\n","2. Вовлечённость (ER — Engagement Rate)\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Calculate the average number of likes, comments and views on the post regarding the number of subscribers.\n\n","Посчитайте среднее количество лайков, комментариев и просмотров на пост относительно числа подписчиков.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Good ER: 5-10%\n\n","Хороший ER: 5–10%\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Medium: 2–4%\n\n","Средний: 2–4%\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Bad: less than 2%\n\n","Плохой: меньше 2%\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["The higher the involvement, the greater the chance that advertising will “come in”.\n\n","Чем выше вовлечённость, тем больше шанс, что реклама «зайдёт».\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["3. Correspondence to the niche\n\n","3. Соответствие нише\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["If you are selling cosmetics, it is better to choose a beauty blogger, not an ITSHAN. ","Если вы продаёте косметику, лучше выбрать бьюти-блогера, а не айтишника. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["The blogger content should be logically connected with your product, otherwise the audience will perceive advertising as “sagging”.\n\n","Контент блогера должен быть логично связан с вашим продуктом, иначе аудитория воспримет рекламу как «впаривание».\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["4. Audience in geography and age\n\n","4. Аудитория по географии и возрасту\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Using the statistics (InSights screenshots), specify:\n\n","С помощью статистики (скриншотов Insights) уточняйте:\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["from which country and city the main part of subscribers;\n\n","из какой страны и города основная часть подписчиков;\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["age category;\n\n","возрастная категория;\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["The ratio of men and women.\n\n","соотношение мужчин и женщин.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["For example, to advertise a restaurant in Tashkent by a blogger, whose half an audience from Turkey is pointless.\n\n","Например, рекламировать ресторан в Ташкенте у блогера, у которого половина аудитории из Турции — бессмысленно.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["5. The frequency of advertising posts\n\n","5. Частота рекламных постов\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["If the blogger places advertising every day, subscribers get tired and stop reacting. ","Если блогер размещает рекламу каждый день, подписчики устают и перестают реагировать. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["It is better to choose the one who makes the advertisement moderately and creatively.\n\n","Лучше выбирать того, кто делает рекламу умеренно и креативно.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["6. Content quality\n\n","6. Качество контента\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["See how the blogger gives advertising:\n\n","Посмотрите, как блогер подаёт рекламу:\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Dry copies the customer’s text or adapts to his style?\n\n","сухо копирует текст заказчика или адаптирует под свой стиль?\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Organically enters the content or can it be seen that he “just inserted”?\n\n","органично вписывает в контент или видно, что «просто вставил»?\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["The more natural the presentation, the higher the confidence of the audience.\n\n","Чем естественнее подача, тем выше доверие аудитории.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["7. Experience and reviews\n\n","7. Опыт и отзывы\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Ask a blogger case or reviews of past customers. ","Спросите у блогера кейсы или отзывы прошлых клиентов. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["Experienced influents themselves will show examples of successful integration.\n\n","Опытные инфлюенсеры сами покажут примеры успешных интеграций.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["8. Advertising format\n\n","8. Формат рекламы\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["Agree on the format: story, post, video, review, challeng. ","Договоритесь о формате: сторис, пост, видео, обзор, челлендж. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["Sometimes one creative story works better than three boring posts.\n\n","Иногда одна креативная сторис работает лучше, чем три скучных поста.\n\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["✨ result\n","✨ Итог\n",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"],true]]],["In order for the blogger’s advertising to pay off, you need to look deeper than just the “number of subscribers”. ","Чтобы реклама у блогера окупилась, нужно смотреть глубже, чем просто «количество подписчиков». ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["Analyze the involvement, audience, presentation style and experience. ","Анализируйте вовлечённость, аудиторию, стиль подачи и опыт. ",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]],["The correct choice of blogger \u003d more applications and sales, less budget loss.","Правильный выбор блогера \u003d больше заявок и продаж, меньше потерь бюджета.",null,null,3,null,null,[[null,"offline"]],[[["ba75f5934b877f865d528de1448190d1","efficient_models_2022q2.md"]]]]],null,"ru",null,null,null,null,[]]
